#: website/web/templates/glossary.html:135
msgid ""
"Other actors linked to a given individual. Can represent collaboration, "
"shared infrastructure or repeated co-appearance in operations."
msgstr ""

#: website/web/templates/glossary.html:138
msgid "Groups / Forums relations"
msgstr ""

#: website/web/templates/glossary.html:139
msgid ""
"Links between one actor and multiple groups or markets. RansomLook stores"
" these so users can explore which actors operate across which ecosystems."
msgstr ""

